{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜防範資料外洩(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-25-13-24-30dMAEjvLz.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：防範資料外洩</p><p>近期本港發生連串資料外洩事件，受影響行業包括航空公司、零售業及虛擬保險公司等，企業如何防範資料外洩？市民應怎樣應對？</p><p>嘉賓：電腦保安專家賴灼東</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.452852+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:17:34.956325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:26.187771+00:00","content_hash":"ff321b4db78f094573b86bdc55f6ce75b9dcf54d97c1c41f99ca0369241bea89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.452852+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}